<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil loadings fall 50 pct in latest week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil loadings fall 50 pct in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal tumbled to 291,880 tonnes in the week to July 2 from 595,445 tonnes in the previous week, Shetland Islands Council said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Most lifting stayed in Europe with just one cargo going to the United States.</p>
